* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
* COPYCODE: CCAUDIT
* SYSTEM:   SIFAP - PAYMENT INSPECTION AND ADMINISTRATION SYSTEM
* AUTHOR:   ADILSON BATISTA
* DATE:     15/04/2005
* CHANGED:  09/02/2012 - FERNANDA OLIVEIRA - ADD TS-EVENTO
* CHANGED:  10/07/2015 - ANDERSON LIMA     - ADD BATCH CONTEXT
* PURPOSE:  STANDARD BLOCK FOR WRITING THE AUDIT TRAIL
*           TO FILE 153 (AUDITORIA). REQUIRED IN EVERY
*           MODULE THAT CHANGES DATA - IN-TCU 63/2010.
*           PROVIDES THE GRAVA-AUDITORIA SUBROUTINE.
*
* USE:      1. DECLARE THE VIEW AND REQUIRED FIELDS BELOW
*           2. LOAD #AUD-ACAO / #AUD-ENTIDADE / #AUD-ID /
*              #AUD-CPF / #AUD-DESCRICAO
*           3. PERFORM GRAVA-AUDITORIA
*           4. PLACE "INCLUDE CCAUDIT" AT THE END OF THE MODULE,
*              IN THE SUBROUTINE AREA, BEFORE "END"
*
* REQUIRED VIEW IN THE INCLUDING MODULE'S DEFINE DATA:
*           1 AUDITORIA-V VIEW OF AUDITORIA
*             2 NUM-AUDITORIA    (N15)
*             2 DT-EVENTO        (N8)
*             2 HR-EVENTO        (N6)
*             2 TS-EVENTO        (N14)
*             2 COD-ACAO         (A2)
*             2 COD-MODULO       (A8)
*             2 DES-ACAO         (A80)
*             2 TIPO-ENTIDADE    (A4)
*             2 ID-ENTIDADE      (A15)
*             2 NUM-CPF-AFETADO  (A11)
*             2 USR-EVENTO       (A8)
*             2 NOM-JOB-BATCH    (A16)
*             2 SIT-BATCH        (A1)
*
* REQUIRED FIELDS IN THE INCLUDING MODULE'S DEFINE DATA:
*           1 #AUD-ACAO       (A2)   /* IN IN/AL/EX/BT/ER
*           1 #AUD-ENTIDADE   (A4)   /* IN BENF/PGTO/PROG/SIST
*           1 #AUD-ID         (A15)  /* IN ENTITY KEY
*           1 #AUD-CPF        (A11)  /* IN AFFECTED CPF OR BLANK
*           1 #AUD-DESCRICAO  (A80)  /* IN FREE TEXT
*           1 #AUD-SEQ        (N15)  /* WORK - SEED
*           1 #AUD-TIMN       (N7)   /* WORK - *TIMN
*
* NOTE 1:   ACTION 'CO' (QUERY) MUST NOT BE RECORDED SINCE
*           2010 DUE TO VOLUME - PORT. CGTI 213/2010.
*           THIS ROUTINE DOES NOT BLOCK 'CO'; BLOCKING IS
*           THE CALLER'S RESPONSIBILITY. TICKET 7740.
*
* NOTE 2:   THE DDM FIELD COD-PERFIL IS NOT POPULATED BY
*           THIS ROUTINE. TICKET 7742 - OPEN.
*
* NOTE 3:   THIS COPYCODE DOES NOT CONTAIN ON ERROR - NATURAL
*           ALLOWS ONLY ONE ON ERROR BLOCK PER OBJECT, AND IT
*           BELONGS TO THE CALLING MODULE.
*
* NOTE 4:   THE ROUTINE DOES NOT ISSUE END TRANSACTION.
*           TRANSACTION CONTROL BELONGS TO THE CALLING MODULE.
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
DEFINE SUBROUTINE GRAVA-AUDITORIA
*
  RESET AUDITORIA-V
*
* SEQUENCE SEED - READ ONLY ONCE PER EXECUTION
  IF #AUD-SEQ = 0
    READ (1) AUDITORIA-V BY NUM-AUDITORIA DESCENDING
      MOVE AUDITORIA-V.NUM-AUDITORIA TO #AUD-SEQ
    END-READ
    RESET AUDITORIA-V
  END-IF
  ADD 1 TO #AUD-SEQ
*
* DATE AND TIME STAMP
* *TIMN RETURNS N7 (HHMMSST) - THE DDM STORES N6 (HHMMSS)
  MOVE *DATN TO AUDITORIA-V.DT-EVENTO
  MOVE *TIMN TO #AUD-TIMN
  DIVIDE 10 INTO #AUD-TIMN GIVING AUDITORIA-V.HR-EVENTO
  COMPUTE AUDITORIA-V.TS-EVENTO =
          (AUDITORIA-V.DT-EVENTO * 1000000)
        +  AUDITORIA-V.HR-EVENTO
*
* EVENT IDENTIFICATION
  MOVE #AUD-SEQ       TO AUDITORIA-V.NUM-AUDITORIA
  MOVE #AUD-ACAO      TO AUDITORIA-V.COD-ACAO
  MOVE *PROGRAM       TO AUDITORIA-V.COD-MODULO
  MOVE #AUD-DESCRICAO TO AUDITORIA-V.DES-ACAO
  MOVE #AUD-ENTIDADE  TO AUDITORIA-V.TIPO-ENTIDADE
  MOVE #AUD-ID        TO AUDITORIA-V.ID-ENTIDADE
  MOVE #AUD-CPF       TO AUDITORIA-V.NUM-CPF-AFETADO
  MOVE *USER          TO AUDITORIA-V.USR-EVENTO
*
* BATCH CONTEXT - POPULATED ONLY WHEN ACTION = 'BT'
  IF #AUD-ACAO = 'BT'
    MOVE *INIT-USER TO AUDITORIA-V.NOM-JOB-BATCH
    MOVE 'S'        TO AUDITORIA-V.SIT-BATCH
  END-IF
*
  STORE AUDITORIA-V
*
END-SUBROUTINE
